    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건: $\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$이고 $\\cos(\\pi + \\theta) = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n\n**Step 1: $\\cos(\\pi + \\theta)$ 간단히 하기**\n\n$\\cos(\\pi + \\theta) = -\\cos\\theta = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n\n따라서 $\\cos\\theta = -\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n\n**Step 2: $\\sin\\theta$ 구하기**\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$을 이용하면:\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - \\cos^2\\theta = 1 - \\left(-\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\right)^2$\n\n$= 1 - \\frac{4 \\cdot 5}{25} = 1 - \\frac{20}{25} = 1 - \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{1}{5}$\n\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$이므로 $\\sin\\theta > 0$\n\n따라서 $\\sin\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n\n**Step 3: $\\sin\\theta + \\cos\\theta$ 계산**\n\n$\\sin\\theta + \\cos\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} + \\left(-\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\right)$\n\n$= \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} - \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n\n정답: **②** $-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$",
