    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건:\n- $\\frac{3}{2}\\pi < \\theta < 2\\pi$ (제3, 4사분면)\n- $\\sin(-\\theta) = \\frac{1}{3}$\n\n**Step 1: sin θ 구하기**\n\n$\\sin(-\\theta) = -\\sin\\theta = \\frac{1}{3}$\n\n따라서 $\\sin\\theta = -\\frac{1}{3}$\n\n**Step 2: cos θ 구하기**\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$에서:\n\n$\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^2 + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$\n\n$\\frac{1}{9} + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$\n\n$\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{8}{9}$\n\n$\\cos\\theta = \\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}$\n\n**Step 3: cos θ의 부호 결정**\n\n$\\frac{3}{2}\\pi < \\theta < 2\\pi$이므로 $\\theta$는 제4사분면에 있습니다.\n\n제4사분면에서 $\\cos\\theta > 0$이므로:\n\n$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}$\n\n**Step 4: tan θ 계산**\n\n$\\tan\\theta = \\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta} = \\frac{-\\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}} = -\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{2}}$\n\n$= -\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}} = -\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$",
