    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건: $\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$이고 $\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{4}{9}$\n\n**Step 1: $\\cos\\theta$의 값 구하기**\n\n$\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{4}{9}$이므로 $\\cos\\theta = \\pm\\frac{2}{3}$\n\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$ (2사분면)에서 $\\cos\\theta < 0$이므로:\n$$\\cos\\theta = -\\frac{2}{3}$$\n\n**Step 2: $\\sin^2\\theta$의 값 구하기**\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$을 이용하면:\n$$\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - \\cos^2\\theta = 1 - \\frac{4}{9} = \\frac{5}{9}$$\n\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$ (2사분면)에서 $\\sin\\theta > 0$이므로:\n$$\\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}$$\n\n**Step 3: $\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos\\theta$ 계산**\n\n$$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos\\theta = \\frac{5}{9} + \\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)$$\n\n$$= \\frac{5}{9} - \\frac{6}{9} = -\\frac{1}{9}$$",
    "problem": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$일 때, $\\theta$에 대하여 $\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{4}{9}$일 때, $\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos\\theta$의 값은? [3점]\n\n① $-\\frac{4}{9}$\n② $-\\frac{1}{3}$\n③ $-\\frac{2}{9}$\n④ $-\\frac{1}{9}$\n⑤ $0$"
