    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건: $\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$일 때, $\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\sin\\theta} - \\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\sin\\theta} = 4$\n\n**Step 1: 좌변을 통분**\n\n$$\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\sin\\theta} - \\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\sin\\theta} = \\frac{\\sin\\theta(1+\\sin\\theta) - \\sin\\theta(1-\\sin\\theta)}{(1-\\sin\\theta)(1+\\sin\\theta)}$$\n\n**Step 2: 분자 정리**\n\n$$= \\frac{\\sin\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta - \\sin\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta}{1-\\sin^2\\theta}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{2\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}$$\n\n**Step 3: 주어진 식에 대입**\n\n$$\\frac{2\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta} = 4$$\n\n$$2\\sin^2\\theta = 4\\cos^2\\theta$$\n\n$$\\sin^2\\theta = 2\\cos^2\\theta$$\n\n**Step 4: $\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$ 이용**\n\n$$\\sin^2\\theta = 2\\cos^2\\theta$$에서\n\n$$2\\cos^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$$\n\n$$3\\cos^2\\theta = 1$$\n\n$$\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{1}{3}$$\n\n**Step 5: $\\cos\\theta$ 결정**\n\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$이므로 $\\cos\\theta < 0$\n\n따라서 $\\cos\\theta = -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$",
