    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건을 분석하겠습니다.\n\n**Step 1: 주어진 식 정리**\n\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{a_{k+1} - a_k}{a_k a_{k+1}} = \\frac{1}{n}$$\n\n좌변의 일반항을 부분분수로 분해하면:\n$$\\frac{a_{k+1} - a_k}{a_k a_{k+1}} = \\frac{1}{a_k} - \\frac{1}{a_{k+1}}$$\n\n**Step 2: 망원급수 계산**\n\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\left(\\frac{1}{a_k} - \\frac{1}{a_{k+1}}\\right) = \\frac{1}{a_1} - \\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{n}$$\n\n**Step 3: $a_1$ 대입**\n\n$a_1 = -4$이므로:\n$$\\frac{1}{-4} - \\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{n}$$\n\n$$-\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{n}$$\n\n**Step 4: $a_{n+1}$ 구하기**\n\n$$-\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{n} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{4+n}{4n}$$\n\n$$\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = -\\frac{4+n}{4n}$$\n\n$$a_{n+1} = -\\frac{4n}{4+n}$$\n\n**Step 5: $a_{13}$ 계산**\n\n$n=12$일 때 $a_{13}$을 구합니다:\n\n$$a_{13} = -\\frac{4 \\times 12}{4+12} = -\\frac{48}{16} = -3$$",
