    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건: $\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$이고 $\\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{7}$\n\n**Step 1: $\\cos\\theta$ 구하기**\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$을 이용합니다.\n\n$$\\sin^2\\theta = \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{7}\\right)^2 = \\frac{21}{49} = \\frac{3}{7}$$\n\n$$\\cos^2\\theta = 1 - \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{4}{7}$$\n\n$$\\cos\\theta = \\pm\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{7}} = \\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{7}$$\n\n**Step 2: $\\cos\\theta$의 부호 결정**\n\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\pi$는 제2사분면이므로 $\\cos\\theta < 0$입니다.\n\n따라서 $\\cos\\theta = -\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{7}$\n\n**Step 3: $\\tan\\theta$ 구하기**\n\n$$\\tan\\theta = \\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta} = \\frac{\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{7}}{-\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{7}}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{7} \\times \\frac{7}{-2\\sqrt{7}}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{-2\\sqrt{7}}$$\n\n$$= -\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{2\\sqrt{7}} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{2\\sqrt{7}} \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7}}$$\n\n$$= -\\frac{\\sqrt{147}}{14} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{49 \\times 3}}{14} = -\\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{14}$$\n\n$$= -\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$$\n\n제2사분면에서 $\\tan\\theta < 0$이므로 답은 $-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$입니다.",
    "problem": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}<\\theta<\\pi$인 $\\theta$에 대하여 $\\sin\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{7}$일 때, $\\tan\\theta$의 값은?\n\n① $-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ ② $-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$ ③ $0$ ④ $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$ ⑤ $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"
