    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건:\n- $P(B|A) = \\frac{1}{4}$\n- $P(A|B) = \\frac{1}{3}$\n- $P(A) + P(B) = \\frac{7}{10}$\n\n**Step 1: 조건부 확률 정의 이용**\n\n조건부 확률의 정의에 의해:\n$$P(B|A) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(A)} = \\frac{1}{4}$$\n$$P(A|B) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)} = \\frac{1}{3}$$\n\n따라서:\n$$P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{4}P(A) \\cdots (1)$$\n$$P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{3}P(B) \\cdots (2)$$\n\n**Step 2: $P(A)$와 $P(B)$의 관계식**\n\n(1)과 (2)에서:\n$$\\frac{1}{4}P(A) = \\frac{1}{3}P(B)$$\n$$P(A) = \\frac{4}{3}P(B) \\cdots (3)$$\n\n**Step 3: $P(A)$와 $P(B)$ 구하기**\n\n(3)을 $P(A) + P(B) = \\frac{7}{10}$에 대입:\n$$\\frac{4}{3}P(B) + P(B) = \\frac{7}{10}$$\n$$\\frac{7}{3}P(B) = \\frac{7}{10}$$\n$$P(B) = \\frac{3}{10}$$\n\n따라서:\n$$P(A) = \\frac{7}{10} - \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{4}{10} = \\frac{2}{5}$$\n\n**Step 4: $P(A \\cap B)$ 계산**\n\n$$P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{4}P(A) = \\frac{1}{4} \\times \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{2}{20} = \\frac{1}{10}$$\n\n검증: $P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{3}P(B) = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{1}{10}$ ✓\n\n**답: $P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{10}$**",
    "problem": "두 사건 $A, B$에 대하여\n\n$$P(B|A) = \\frac{1}{4}, \\quad P(A|B) = \\frac{1}{3}, \\quad P(A) + P(B) = \\frac{7}{10}$$\n\n일 때, $P(A \\cap B)$의 값은? [3점]\n\n① $\\frac{1}{7}$\n\n② $\\frac{1}{8}$\n\n③ $\\frac{1}{9}$\n\n④ $\\frac{1}{10}$\n\n⑤ $\\frac{1}{11}$"
