    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건:\n- $a_1 = 1$\n- $\\sum_{k=1}^{n}(a_k - a_{k+1}) = -n^2 + n$\n\n**Step 1: 좌변을 전개**\n\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{n}(a_k - a_{k+1}) = (a_1 - a_2) + (a_2 - a_3) + \\cdots + (a_n - a_{n+1})$$\n\n이는 망원급수(telescoping series)이므로:\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{n}(a_k - a_{k+1}) = a_1 - a_{n+1}$$\n\n**Step 2: $a_{n+1}$ 구하기**\n\n$$a_1 - a_{n+1} = -n^2 + n$$\n\n$a_1 = 1$을 대입하면:\n$$1 - a_{n+1} = -n^2 + n$$\n\n$$a_{n+1} = 1 + n^2 - n = n^2 - n + 1$$\n\n**Step 3: $a_n$ 구하기**\n\n위 식에서 $n$을 $n-1$로 바꾸면:\n$$a_n = (n-1)^2 - (n-1) + 1$$\n\n$$a_n = n^2 - 2n + 1 - n + 1 + 1$$\n\n$$a_n = n^2 - 3n + 3$$\n\n**Step 4: $a_{11}$ 계산**\n\n$$a_{11} = 11^2 - 3(11) + 3$$\n\n$$a_{11} = 121 - 33 + 3 = 91$$\n\n**검증:** $a_1 = 1 - 3 + 3 = 1$ ✓",
