    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 적분: $\\int_{e}^{e^2} \\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x^2} dx$\n\n**Step 1: 부분적분 설정**\n\n$u = \\ln x - 1$, $dv = \\frac{1}{x^2}dx$로 놓으면:\n- $du = \\frac{1}{x}dx$\n- $v = -\\frac{1}{x}$\n\n**Step 2: 부분적분 공식 적용**\n\n$$\\int_{e}^{e^2} \\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x^2} dx = \\left[-\\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x}\\right]_{e}^{e^2} - \\int_{e}^{e^2} \\left(-\\frac{1}{x}\\right) \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} dx$$\n\n$$= \\left[-\\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x}\\right]_{e}^{e^2} + \\int_{e}^{e^2} \\frac{1}{x^2} dx$$\n\n**Step 3: 첫 번째 항 계산**\n\n$$\\left[-\\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x}\\right]_{e}^{e^2} = -\\frac{2-1}{e^2} - \\left(-\\frac{1-1}{e}\\right)$$\n\n$$= -\\frac{1}{e^2} - 0 = -\\frac{1}{e^2}$$\n\n**Step 4: 두 번째 항 계산**\n\n$$\\int_{e}^{e^2} \\frac{1}{x^2} dx = \\left[-\\frac{1}{x}\\right]_{e}^{e^2} = -\\frac{1}{e^2} - \\left(-\\frac{1}{e}\\right) = -\\frac{1}{e^2} + \\frac{1}{e}$$\n\n**Step 5: 전체 결과**\n\n$$-\\frac{1}{e^2} + \\left(-\\frac{1}{e^2} + \\frac{1}{e}\\right) = -\\frac{2}{e^2} + \\frac{1}{e}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{-2 + e}{e^2} = \\frac{e-2}{e^2}$$",
    "problem": "$\\int_{e}^{e^2} \\frac{\\ln x - 1}{x^2} dx$의 값은? [3점]\n\n① $\\frac{e+2}{e^2}$\n\n② $\\frac{e+1}{e^2}$\n\n③ $\\frac{1}{e}$\n\n④ $\\frac{e-1}{e^2}$\n\n⑤ $\\frac{e-2}{e^2}$"
