    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 조건: $\\cos\\theta = \\frac{1}{7}$\n\n**Step 1: 기본 삼각함수값 구하기**\n\n$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{1}{7}$이므로\n\n$\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - \\cos^2\\theta = 1 - \\frac{1}{49} = \\frac{48}{49}$\n\n$\\sin\\theta = \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{7}$ (양수, 제1사분면 가정)\n\n**Step 2: $\\tan\\theta$ 구하기**\n\n$\\tan\\theta = \\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta} = \\frac{\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{7}}{\\frac{1}{7}} = 4\\sqrt{3}$\n\n**Step 3: $\\csc\\theta$ 구하기**\n\n$\\csc\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta} = \\frac{1}{\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{7}} = \\frac{7}{4\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{12}$\n\n**Step 4: $\\csc\\theta \\times \\tan\\theta$ 계산**\n\n$\\csc\\theta \\times \\tan\\theta = \\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{12} \\times 4\\sqrt{3}$\n\n$= \\frac{7\\sqrt{3} \\times 4\\sqrt{3}}{12}$\n\n$= \\frac{28 \\times 3}{12}$\n\n$= \\frac{84}{12}$\n\n$= 7$\n\n따라서 답은 **7**입니다.",
