    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 함수방정식: $2f(x) + \\frac{1}{x^2}f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}$\n\n**Step 1: 함수 $f(x)$ 구하기**\n\n주어진 식을 $x$에 대한 식 (1)이라 하고, $x$ 대신 $\\frac{1}{x}$를 대입하면:\n\n$$2f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + \\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2}f(x) = \\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{x}} + \\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2}$$\n\n$$2f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + x^2 f(x) = x + x^2 \\quad \\cdots (2)$$\n\n**Step 2: 연립방정식 풀기**\n\n식 (1): $2f(x) + \\frac{1}{x^2}f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}$\n\n식 (2)에서 $f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$를 구하면:\n$$f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = \\frac{x + x^2 - x^2f(x)}{2}$$\n\n이를 식 (1)에 대입:\n$$2f(x) + \\frac{1}{x^2} \\cdot \\frac{x + x^2 - x^2f(x)}{2} = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}$$\n\n$$2f(x) + \\frac{x + x^2 - x^2f(x)}{2x^2} = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}$$\n\n양변에 $2x^2$를 곱하면:\n$$4x^2f(x) + x + x^2 - x^2f(x) = 2x + 2$$\n\n$$3x^2f(x) = 2x + 2 - x - x^2$$\n\n$$3x^2f(x) = x + 2 - x^2$$\n\n$$f(x) = \\frac{x + 2 - x^2}{3x^2} = \\frac{1}{3x} + \\frac{2}{3x^2} - \\frac{1}{3}$$\n\n**Step 3: 적분 계산**\n\n$$\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{2} f(x)dx = \\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{2} \\left(\\frac{1}{3x} + \\frac{2}{3x^2} - \\frac{1}{3}\\right)dx$$\n\n$$= \\left[\\frac{1}{3}\\ln|x| - \\frac{2}{3x} - \\frac{1}{3}x\\right]_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{2}$$\n\n$$= \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\ln 2 - \\frac{2}{6} - \\frac{2}{3}\\right) - \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\ln\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{2}{\\frac{3}{2}} - \\frac{1}{6}\\right)$$\n\n$$= \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\ln 2 - \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}\\right) - \\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln 2 - \\frac{4}{3} - \\frac{1}{6}\\right)$$\n\n$$= \\frac{1}{3}\\ln 2 + \\frac{1}{3}\\ln 2 - 1 + \\frac{4}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{2}{3}\\ln 2 + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + 1 = \\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + 1$$\n\n따라서 답은 **(4) $\\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + 1$**",
    "problem": "$x > 0$에서 정의된 연속함수 $f(x)$가 모든 양수 $x$에 대하여\n\n$$2f(x) + \\frac{1}{x^2}f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}$$\n\n을 만족할 때, $\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{2} f(x)dx$의 값은? [4점]\n\n① $\\frac{\\ln 2}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}$\n\n② $\\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}$\n\n③ $\\frac{\\ln 2}{3} + 1$\n\n④ $\\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + 1$\n\n⑤ $\\frac{2\\ln 2}{3} + \\frac{3}{2}$"
