    "explanation": "**[풀이]**\n\n주어진 함수를 정리하겠습니다.\n\n$$f(x) = \\cos^2\\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\pi\\right) - \\cos\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) + k$$\n\n**Step 1: $\\cos^2\\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\pi\\right)$ 정리**\n\n배각공식 $\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{1 + \\cos 2\\theta}{2}$를 이용하면:\n\n$$\\cos^2\\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\pi\\right) = \\frac{1 + \\cos\\left(2x - \\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right)}{2}$$\n\n$\\cos\\left(2x - \\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right) = \\cos\\left(2x - \\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right) = -\\sin(2x)$ 이므로:\n\n$$\\cos^2\\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\pi\\right) = \\frac{1 - \\sin(2x)}{2}$$\n\n**Step 2: 함수를 $t$로 치환**\n\n$t = \\cos\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$로 놓으면, $t \\in [-1, 1]$입니다.\n\n$\\sin(2x)$를 $t$로 표현하면:\n\n$$\\sin(2x) = \\sin\\left(2\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) + \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = \\cos\\left(2\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right) = 2\\cos^2\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) - 1 = 2t^2 - 1$$\n\n따라서:\n$$f(x) = \\frac{1 - (2t^2 - 1)}{2} - t + k = \\frac{2 - 2t^2}{2} - t + k = 1 - t^2 - t + k$$\n\n**Step 3: 최댓값과 최솟값 구하기**\n\n$$g(t) = -t^2 - t + (1+k), \\quad t \\in [-1, 1]$$\n\n$g'(t) = -2t - 1 = 0$에서 $t = -\\frac{1}{2}$\n\n$t = -\\frac{1}{2}$은 $[-1, 1]$에 포함됩니다.\n\n각 점에서의 함수값:\n- $g(-1) = -1 + 1 + (1+k) = 1 + k$\n- $g\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = -\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{2} + (1+k) = \\frac{5}{4} + k$ (최댓값)\n- $g(1) = -1 - 1 + (1+k) = -1 + k$\n\n**Step 4: 최댓값과 최솟값의 합**\n\n최댓값: $\\frac{5}{4} + k$\n\n최솟값: $-1 + k$\n\n최댓값 = 3, 최솟값 = $m$이므로:\n\n$$\\frac{5}{4} + k = 3 \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{7}{4}$$\n\n$$m = -1 + k = -1 + \\frac{7}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$$\n\n따라서:\n$$k + m = \\frac{7}{4} + \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{10}{4} = \\frac{5}{2}$$",
